Adds automatic HP, FP, and Stamina regeneration over time, with configurable rates - plus optional HP/FP/Stamina restore the instant your own weapon attack lands a hit, either a fixed amount/percent of your max stat, or a percent of the damage you just dealt (true lifesteal).

Default configuration ([b]AutoRegen.ini[/b]):
[code][General]
ReloadKey=F5                    ; hotkey that reloads this file while the game is running

[Regen Per Tick]
Regen.PerTick.Enabled=true
Regen.PerTick.Trigger=0         ; 0 = always, 1 = out of combat only, 2 = in combat only
Regen.PerTick.Interval=1000     ; how often (ms) HP/FP/Stamina are topped up
Regen.PerTick.Unit=1            ; 0 = flat points, 1 = percent of max stat
Regen.PerTick.HP=0.5
Regen.PerTick.FP=1
Regen.PerTick.Stamina=5

[Regen Per Hit]
Regen.PerHit.Enabled=false
Regen.PerHit.Trigger=0          ; 0 = flat points, 1 = percent of max stat, 2 = percent of damage dealt
Regen.PerHit.DamageType=0       ; 0 = melee hits only, 1 = ranged/spell hits only, 2 = both
Regen.PerHit.HP=0.5
Regen.PerHit.FP=1
Regen.PerHit.Stamina=5[/code]

[b][color=#E74C3C]Only use in offline mode with EAC disabled![/color][/b]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

[b]Option 1 - [url=https://github.com/soulsmods/ModEngine2/releases]Mod Engine 2[/url] (recommended)[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download Mod Engine 2 from the link above and extract it into your game folder (the same folder as [i]eldenring.exe[/i]).[/*]
[*]Download this mod, then create a folder to hold it and its INI file - for example, inside your game folder create a [b]natives[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]Open [b]config_eldenring.toml[/b] and edit [b]external_dlls = [ ][/b] to add the DLL, e.g.:
[code]external_dlls = [
    "natives\\AutoRegen.dll",
][/code]
[/*]
[*]Launch the game using Mod Engine 2's launcher, [b]modengine2_launcher.exe[/b].[/*]
[/list]

[b]Option 2 - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/117]Elden Mod Loader[/url][/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download Elden Mod Loader from the link above and extract it into your game folder.[/*]
[*]Download this mod and drag [b]AutoRegen.dll[/b] and [b]AutoRegen.ini[/b] into the [b]mods[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]Launch the game - the mod will be loaded automatically.[/*]
[/list]

